<title>UK: ISO details 96/97 world sugar output estimates.</title>
<headline>ISO details 96/97 world sugar output estimates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a table of sugar output estimates for the world's major cane and beet producers, as forecast by the International Sugar Organization (ISO) in its latest report.</p>
<p>Figures are in millions of tonnes, raw value.</p>
<p>COUNTRY		   1996/97		   1995/96</p>
<p>Australia		   5.8			 5.4</p>
<p>Brazil		     14.0			14.0</p>
<p>China			 7.5			 6.6</p>
<p>Cuba			  5.1			 4.6</p>
<p>European Union	   17.0			17.0</p>
<p>India			16.0			17.7</p>
<p>Russia			1.9			 2.2</p>
<p>Thailand		    6.8			 6.4</p>
<p>Ukraine		     3.2			 3.9</p>
<p>WORLD TOTAL	     123.8		     123.6</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
